      "text": [
        "3738 - وَ قَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : \"أَيُّمَا مُسْلِمٍ أَقَالَ مُسْلِماً نَدَامَةً فِي اَلْبَيْعِ أَقَالَهُ اَللَّهُ عَثْرَتَهُ يَوْمَ اَلْقِيَامَةِ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3738 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"Any Muslim who cancels a sale for another Muslim who regrets it, Allah (swt) will cancel his slip on the Day of Judgment.\""
        ]
      }
